eseburger is a kind of hamburger with cheese on top of the meat.","e":"Can I have a cheeseburger?"}]}]},"faucet":{"h":"faucet","i":"/ˈfɔːsɪt/","a":"en-us-faucet.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"; (countable) A faucet is a fitting of a sink that allows water to flow through it for washing ones' hands or doing the dishes.","e":"Can you turn the faucet on for me so that I can wash my hands?"}]}]},"faucets":{"h":"faucets","l":"faucet","q":"noun"},"cheeseburgers":{"h":"cheeseburgers","l":"cheeseburger","q":"noun"},"condom":{"h":"condom","i":"/ˈkɒn.dɒm/","a":"en-us-condom.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A condom is something you put over your penis to stop sperm from getting into the vagina when having sex.","e":"It can be hard to talk about safer sex or tell your partner to use a condom."}]}]},"condoms":{"h":"condoms","l":"condom","q":"noun"},"daffodils":{"h":"daffodils","l":"daffodil","q":"noun"},"whisker":{"h":"whisker","i":"/ʍɪskə(r)/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-whisker.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A whisker is a long hair that grows on either side of the mouth of a cat or other animal.","e":"The whisker of the cat was long and white."},{"m":"(countable) A whisker is any hair of a beard."},{"m":"A whisker is a small distance between two things.","e":"That punch missed hitting him by a whisker!"}]}]},"whiskers":{"h":"whiskers","a":"En-us-whiskers.ogg","l":"whisker","q":"noun"},"tuna":{"h":"tuna","i":"/ˈtjuː.nə/","a":"en-us-tuna.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A tuna is any one of several kinds of fish in the family, of the genus.","e":"The fishermen hauled the 120 pound tuna over the side of the boat."}]}]},"tunas":{"h":"tunas","l":"tuna","q":"noun"},"stilt":{"h":"stilt","i":"/stɪlt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-stilt.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A stilt is a long tall usually wooden pole that people walk on usually in parades."},{"m":"(countable) A stilt is a tall pillar or post used to support some structur