gerator is rancid."},{"m":"If someone is rancid, they are offensive.","e":"His comments about you were rancid in nature."}]}]},"shylock":{"h":"shylock","i":"/ˈʃaɪlɑk/","a":"en-au-shylock.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable);; A shylock is a loan shark."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive);; If you shylock, you lend money at extremely high interest rates."}]}]},"shylocks":{"h":"shylocks","l":"shylock","q":"noun"},"shylocked":{"h":"shylocked","l":"shylock","q":"verb"},"shylocking":{"h":"shylocking","l":"shylock","q":"verb"},"choppy":{"h":"choppy","i":"/ˈtʃɒ.pi/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-choppy.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If the surface of the water is choppy, it has many small, rough waves.","e":"The boat was going over really choppy waters because of the storm."}]}]},"choppier":{"h":"choppier","l":"choppy","q":"adjective"},"choppiest":{"h":"choppiest","l":"choppy","q":"adjective"},"crane":{"h":"crane","i":"/kreɪn/","a":"en-us-crane.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A crane is a kind of bird that has a long neck and legs.","e":"On our trip to China, we saw a beautiful crane catching fish in the river."},{"m":"(countable) A crane is a kind of machine that is used for lifting very heavy things for construction or industrial purposes.","e":"The crane lifted up a metal bar to build the house."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you crane, you extend your neck.","e":"He craned his neck to take a closer look."}]}]},"assistant":{"h":"assistant","i":"/əˈsɪstənt/","a":"en-us-assistant.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An assistant is a person who helps (or assists) another person.","e":"The doctor's assistant held his tools."}]}]},"assistants":{"h":"assistants","i":"/əˈsɪstəntz/","a":"en-us-assistants.ogg","l":"assistant","q":"noun"},"fuller":{"h":"fuller","i":"/ˈfʊlə/","a":"en-us-fuller.ogg","l":"full","q":"adjective","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A fuller is a convex, rounded, or grooved tool that is used by bla