able) A Nazi is one who imposes their views on others; one who is unfairly oppressive or needlessly strict."}]},{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Something that is Nazi is related to the Nazis.","e":"Nazi Party"}]}]},"cardinal":{"h":"cardinal","i":"/ˈkɑː.dɪ.nəl/","a":"en-us-cardinal.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"A cardinal rule, sin, or principle is one of fundamental importance; it is very important."},{"m":"The cardinal directions are the main four ones: (north, east. south, west)."},{"m":"The cardinal numbers are the ones you count with (one, two, three,...) and not of the ones you rank with (first, second, third,...)."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A cardinal is a kind of bird found in the Americas.","e":"A cardinal made a nest in our tree."},{"m":"(countable) A cardinal is a high-ranking priest in the Roman Catholic Church.","e":"is a cardinal."}]}]},"cardinals":{"h":"cardinals","l":"cardinal","q":"noun"},"nazis":{"h":"nazis","l":"nazi","q":"noun"},"bum":{"h":"bum","i":"/bʌm/","a":"en-ca-bum.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A bum is someone who is usually homeless and poor."},{"m":"buttocks."}]}]},"cellar":{"h":"cellar","i":"/ˈsɛlə(r)/","a":"en-au-cellar.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A cellar is a room to store things.","e":"The wine is stored in the cellar."}]}]},"cellars":{"h":"cellars","l":"cellar","q":"noun"},"bums":{"h":"bums","l":"bum","q":"noun"},"turbine":{"h":"turbine","i":"/'tɜ(r)baɪn/","a":"en-us-turbine.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A turbine is a machine that uses the kinetic energy of a constant stream of liquid to move a shaft.","e":"The company uses a wind turbine to make the electricity they need to run their factory."}]}]},"turbines":{"h":"turbines","l":"turbine","q":"noun"},"graveyard":{"h":"graveyard","i":"/ˈɡreɪvˌjɑrd/","a":"en-us-graveyard.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A graveyard is a piece of land where dead people are buried.","e":"Dead people were buried in the graveyard."}]}]},"gr