,"e":"The student was very absorbed in his studies."}]}]},"absorbing":{"h":"absorbing","i":"/əbˈzɔː.bɪŋ/","a":"en-us-absorbing.ogg","l":"absorb","q":"verb"},"cuban":{"h":"Cuban","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"A Cuban is someone from the island of Cuba.","e":"In Havana live lots of Cubans."}]}]},"alaskan":{"h":"Alaskan","i":"/əˈlæskən/","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An Alaskan is someone from the U.S. state of Alaska.","e":"In Alaska live lots of Alaskans."}]}]},"cubans":{"h":"Cubans","l":"cuban","q":"noun"},"alaskans":{"h":"Alaskans","l":"alaskan","q":"noun"},"bahamas":{"h":"Bahamas","i":"/bəˈhɑː.məz/","a":"en-us-Bahamas.ogg","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"The Bahamas is a country in the Caribbean.","e":"The Bahamas are a group of islands."}]}]},"milton":{"h":"Milton","i":"/ˈmɪltən/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Milton.wav","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Milton is the name of many towns in Canada and the United States."}]}]},"seahorse":{"h":"seahorse","a":"En-us-seahorse.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A seahorse is a small fish that lives in the ocean.","e":"Have you seen the seahorse behind the stone?"}]}]},"dong":{"h":"dong","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A dong is a slang term for the penis."}]}]},"logos":{"h":"logos","l":"logo","q":"noun","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(philosophy) Logos is the principle that governs cosmos."},{"m":"Logos is a kind of rhetoric in which the writer uses logic as the main argument."}]}]},"cosmos":{"h":"cosmos","i":"/ˈkɒz.mɒs/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-cosmos1.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"The cosmos is the universe.","e":"He thought it was the brightest star in the cosmos until he saw a brighter one the next day."}]}]},"ale":{"h":"ale","i":"/eɪl/","a":"en-us-ale.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Ale is an alcoholic drink made with malt and hops.","e":"He looked forward to a cold ale after a hard day at work."}]}]},"pimp":{"h":"pimp","i":"/pɪmp/","a":"en-ca-pimp.oga","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{