into surgery."}]}]},"surgeries":{"h":"surgeries","l":"surgery","q":"noun"},"vice":{"h":"vice","i":"/vaɪs/","a":"en-us-vice.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A vice is an immoral or bad habit.","e":"Smoking is a vice."},{"m":"(countable) (UK) A vice is an instrument that consists of two jaws and is closed by a screw or lever. It is used for holding work, such as filing."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you vice something, you clamp it with a [[#Noun|vice]]."}]}]},"vices":{"h":"vices","a":"en-us-vices.ogg","l":"vice","q":"noun"},"courage":{"h":"courage","i":"/ˈkʌrɪdʒ/","a":"en-us-courage.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Courage is the quality of not being afraid easily.","e":"The warrior had great courage."}]}]},"courageous":{"h":"courageous","i":"/kəˈreɪdʒəs/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-courageous.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"To be courageous is having courage (not being afraid).","e":"The warrior was very courageous."}]}]},"nonadjustable":{"h":"nonadjustable","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Nonadjustable is something that is not adjustable (cannot be adjusted).","e":"The chair's height was nonadjustable."}]}]},"disadvantaged":{"h":"disadvantaged","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Having a disadvantage (a handicap or weakness).","e":"The football team was disadvantaged because one of their players was missing."},{"m":"Being poor (without money)."}]}]},"mendelevium":{"h":"mendelevium","i":"/ˌmɛndəˈliːviəm/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-mendelevium.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Mendelevium is a chemical element. It is a radioactive metal with the atomic number 101 and the symbol Md."}]}]},"radioactive":{"h":"radioactive","i":"/ˌreɪdioʊˈaktɪv/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-radioactive.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Radioactive is something which shows radioactivity.","e":"The metal was radioactive."}]}]},"shorten":{"h":"shorten","i":"/ˈʃɔːtn/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-shorten.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"