ly done.","e":"With a sudden involuntary motion, he broke the glass."}]}]},"invasion":{"h":"invasion","i":"[ɪnˈveɪʒən]","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Invasion is the act of invading. It is the act of an army that attacks for gaining land or sack."},{"m":"Invasion means any entry to an area not owned before; \"an invasion of locusts\"."}]}]},"invasions":{"h":"invasions","l":"invasion","q":"noun"},"pawn":{"h":"pawn","i":"/pɔːn/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-pawn.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) (chess) A pawn in the game of chess is a piece that can only move forward. Each player will get eight pawns."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you pawn a valuable object, you offer it to a money-lender as security for a loan of money. When money is repaid, plus interest, the object(s) are said to be \"redeemed\".","e":"Queen Eleanor pawned the crown jewels of England."}]}]},"ghana":{"h":"Ghana","i":"/ˈɡɑːnə/","a":"en-us-Ghana.ogg","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Ghana is a country in Africa. Its full name is The Republic of Ghana."}]}]},"jetplane":{"h":"jetplane","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A jetplane is like an airplane."}]}]},"pawns":{"h":"pawns","l":"pawn","q":"noun"},"interrogate":{"h":"interrogate","i":"/ɪnˈtɛrəɡeɪt/","a":"en-us-interrogate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you interrogate someone, you ask them questions to get information.","e":"The police officer interrogated the murder suspect."}]}]},"interrogated":{"h":"interrogated","l":"interrogate","q":"verb"},"interrogating":{"h":"interrogating","l":"interrogate","q":"verb"},"jetplanes":{"h":"jetplanes","l":"jetplane","q":"noun"},"mustard":{"h":"mustard","i":"[ˈmʌs.tɚd]","a":"en-us-mustard.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Mustard is a yellow sauce which can go on hotdogs, etc."},{"m":"A dark yellow colour, the colour of mustard."}]}]},"mustards":{"h":"mustards","l":"mustard","q":"noun"},"judas":{"h":"Judas","i":"/ˈdʒuːdəs/","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Judas i