rn with."}]}]},"hermaphroditism":{"h":"hermaphroditism","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(singular) Hermaphroditism is the condition of having both male and female reproductive organs."}]}]},"compromised":{"h":"compromised","l":"compromise","q":"verb"},"compromising":{"h":"compromising","l":"compromise","q":"verb"},"hermaphroditic":{"h":"hermaphroditic","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"of or pertaining to hermaphroditism."}]}]},"insolent":{"h":"insolent","i":"/ɪnˈsə.lənt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-insolent.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Insolent is to be contemptuous, arrogant or insulting. A man is insolent if he acts 'above himself'.","e":"On that occasion, Brummel was certainly insolent."}]}]},"androgynous":{"h":"androgynous","i":"/ænˈdrɒd͡ʒ.ɪn.əs/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-androgynous.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Androgynous is being both male and female."},{"m":"Androgynous is having an unclear sexual identity."},{"m":"Androgynous is looking neither masculine or feminine."}]}]},"intersexual":{"h":"intersexual","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"occurring or existing between the sexes."},{"m":"relating to or being an intersex."}]}]},"sawdust":{"h":"sawdust","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Sawdust is the dust which is left over from a piece of wood after it has been cut.","e":"The sawdust was all over me."}]}]},"nipponese":{"h":"Nipponese","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Nipponese people are inhabitants of Japan.","e":"Nipponese people are from Japan."}]},{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"A Nipponese is a Japanese."}]}]},"samurai":{"h":"samurai","i":"/ˈsæm(j)ʊraɪ/","a":"en-us-samurai.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) a samurai is a Japanese warrior","e":"The samurai has a sword in his hand."}]}]},"gamma-hydroxybutyrate":{"h":"gamma-hydroxybutyrate","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Gamma-hydroxybutyrate is a drug which is used to relax people. It is a strict drug, which is most often used by the homosexual community."}]}]},"lamentable