.","e":"The abolition of slavery in the United States meant slaves were now free."}]}]},"abolitions":{"h":"abolitions","l":"abolition","q":"noun"},"abridge":{"h":"abridge","i":"/əˈbrɪd͡ʒ/","a":"en-us-abridge.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"To abridge something is to make it shorter or less.","e":"This book will be abridged so that children can read it."}]}]},"abridges":{"h":"abridges","l":"abridge","q":"verb"},"abridged":{"h":"abridged","i":"/əˈbrɪdʒd/","a":"en-us-abridged.ogg","l":"abridge","q":"verb","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is abridged, it has been shortened.","e":"The abridged version of the book lacked some important elements of the story."}]}]},"abridging":{"h":"abridging","l":"abridge","q":"verb"},"grilse":{"h":"grilse","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A grilse is a young salmon after its first return from the sea.","e":"Salmon are fry as babies, parr as children, smolt as adolescents, and grilse as adults."}]}]},"grilses":{"h":"grilses","l":"grilse","q":"noun"},"abraham":{"h":"Abraham","i":"/ˈeɪ.brə.hæm/","a":"en-us-Abraham.ogg","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"(Bible, Quran) Abraham was the founder of the Hebrew nation."}]}]},"hebrew":{"h":"Hebrew","i":"/ˈhiːbruː/","a":"en-us-Hebrew.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Jewish."},{"m":"A Hebrew book is written in the Hebrew language."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A Jewish person."},{"m":"The Hebrew language."}]}]},"hebrews":{"h":"Hebrews","l":"hebrew","q":"noun"},"hedgerow":{"h":"hedgerow","i":"/ˈhɛd͡ʒrəʊ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-hedgerow.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A hedgerow is a row of bushes or trees that form a hedge."}]}]},"hedgerows":{"h":"hedgerows","l":"hedgerow","q":"noun"},"heedless":{"h":"heedless","i":"/ˈhiːdləs/","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If someone is heedless, they are careless or thoughtless."}]}]},"abstain":{"h":"abstain","i":"/əbˈsteɪn/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-abstain.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"To abstain from something is to do without it or to keep yourself from doing it.","e":"If you abstain from eating candy, you will not be so fat."}]}]},"abstains":{"h":"abstains","l":"abstain","q":"verb"},"abstained":{"h":"abstained","l":"abstain","q":"verb"},"abstaining":{"h":"abstaining","l":"abstain","q":"verb"},"abstractions":{"h":"abstractions","l":"abstraction","q":"noun"},"absolve":{"h":"absolve","i":"/əbˈzɒlv/","a":"en-us-absolve.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"To absolve someone is to free that person from a sin or from a promise.","e":"The king absolved his servant of the oath."}]}]},"absolves":{"h":"absolves","l":"absolve","q":"verb"},"absolved":{"h":"absolved","l":"absolve","q":"verb"},"absolving":{"h":"absolving","l":"absolve","q":"verb"},"abyss":{"h":"abyss","i":"/əˈbɪs/","a":"en-us-abyss.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An abyss is a very deep crack in the earth."}]}]},"abysses":{"h":"abysses","l":"abyss","q":"noun"},"persistence":{"h":"persistence","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) The act of being persistent."},{"m":"(uncountable) If someone shows persistence, they are determined to continue and do not give up quickly.","e":"Even though this is difficult, I appreciate your persistence."}]}]},"oblation":{"h":"oblation","i":"/əʊˈbleɪʃən/","a":"En-us-oblation.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"An oblation is an offering for religious or charitable uses."},{"m":"(uncountable) Oblation is the act of making of an offering, now especially to a god or spirit."}]}]},"slack":{"h":"slack","i":"/slæk/","a":"en-au-slack.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is slack, it hangs loose and is not held tight.","e":"Bring the boats closer together so that the rope between them becomes slack."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"To slack is to be lazy and avoid doing work.","e":"Once he stopped slacking on his homework his grades improved."}]}]},"slacks":{"h":"slacks","l":"slack","q":"verb"},"slacked":{"h":"slacked","l":"slack","q":"verb"},"slacking":{"h":"slacking","l":"slack","q":"v