ething to be abased (lowered in status)."}]}]},"abashment":{"h":"abashment","i":"/əˈbæʃ.mənt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-abashment.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An abashment is an action that makes someone embarrassed."}]}]},"abattoir":{"h":"abattoir","i":"/ˈæb.əˌtwɑː(r)/","a":"en-us-abattoir.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A slaughterhouse; a place where animals are killed."}]}]},"abbacy":{"h":"abbacy","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) The experience of being an abbot."}]}]},"abbreviator":{"h":"abbreviator","i":"/əˈbriː.viˌeɪ.tə/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An abbreviator is someone or something that abbreviates (makes something shorter)."}]}]},"abcoulomb":{"h":"abcoulomb","i":"/ˌæb.kuˈlɑm/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An abcoulomb is a measure of electricity that is equal to ten coulombs."}]}]},"abdicable":{"h":"abdicable","i":"/ˈæb.də.kə.bəl/","a":"en-us-abdicable.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If someone is abdicable, they are capable of giving up their reign or power over a country."}]}]},"abduce":{"h":"abduce","i":"/əb.ˈdjuːs/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-abduce.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you abduce something, you cause it to move away from a location."}]}]},"abdication":{"h":"abdication","i":"/ˌæb.dəˈkeɪ.ʃən/","a":"en-us-abdication.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) Abdication is the action of losing reign or power over a country."}]}]},"abdicator":{"h":"abdicator","i":"/ˈæb.dəˌkei.tɚ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-abdicator.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An abdicator is someone who loses their reign or power over a country."}]}]},"abdominous":{"h":"abdominous","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Having a chest that is large."}]}]},"aberrance":{"h":"aberrance","i":"/ˈæ.bɛr.n̩s/","a":"en-us-aberrance.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An aberrance is something that is unusual or weird."}]}]},"aberrate":{"h":"aberrate","i":"/ˈæb.ə.reɪt/","