y is the field of study in philosophy that studies ethical and aesthetic values."}]}]},"bay":{"h":"bay","i":"/beɪ/","a":"en-us-bay.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A bay is water with land around most of it.","e":"She visited."},{"m":"(countable) A bay is also a kind of horse that is reddish brown with black legs, mane, and tail.","e":"The horse was a bay horse."}]}]},"bays":{"h":"bays","l":"bay","q":"noun"},"bungalow":{"h":"bungalow","i":"/ˈbʌŋɡələʊ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bungalow.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A house with only one floor or storey.","e":"They lived in a bungalow."}]}]},"bungalows":{"h":"bungalows","l":"bungalow","q":"noun"},"domino":{"h":"domino","i":"/ˈdɒmɪnəʊ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-domino.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A tile with two parts, both with a number of dots (\"pips\") between 0 and 6.","e":"This domino has 6 pips on both squares."}]}]},"dominos":{"h":"dominos","l":"domino","q":"noun"},"dominoes":{"h":"dominoes","l":"domino","q":"noun"},"condemn":{"h":"condemn","i":"/kənˈdɛm/","a":"en-us-condemn.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you condemn something, you say it is very bad.","e":"His actions were condemned."},{"m":"If you condemn a building, you say it is not fit for use.","e":"The building was dangerous and has been condemned."}]}]},"condemns":{"h":"condemns","l":"condemn","q":"verb"},"condemned":{"h":"condemned","i":"/kənˈdɛmd/","a":"en-us-condemned.ogg","l":"condemn","q":"verb"},"condemning":{"h":"condemning","l":"condemn","q":"verb"},"disapprove":{"h":"disapprove","i":"/dɪsəˈpruːv/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-disapprove.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you disapprove of something, you think it is wrong and do not approve or agree with it.","e":"She disapproved of his actions."}]}]},"disapproves":{"h":"disapproves","l":"disapprove","q":"verb"},"disapproved":{"h":"disapproved","l":"disapprove","q":"verb"},"disapproving":{"h":"disapproving","l":"disapprove","q":"verb"},"d