able) A crumble is a dessert that came from Britain and is made up of fruits and flour."}]}]},"crumbles":{"h":"crumbles","l":"crumble","q":"verb"},"crumbled":{"h":"crumbled","l":"crumble","q":"verb"},"crumbling":{"h":"crumbling","l":"crumble","q":"verb"},"lgbt":{"h":"LGBT","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(usually plural) A member of the LGBT community."}]}]},"bisexual":{"h":"bisexual","i":"/baɪˈsɛk.sju.əl/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bisexual.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"(sexuality, of humans or other animals) Sexually attracted to members of one or more genders."},{"m":"Of flowers: having both pollen and seeds."},{"m":"Of sporophytes: having both male and female organs."},{"m":"Of gametophytes: producing both eggs and sperm."},{"m":"Of fungi: producing both the \"female\" ascogonium and the \"male\" antheridium."},{"m":"Hermaphroditic.","e":"Midrash and Zohar present Adam as hermaphroditic or bisexual."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(sexuality, of humans or other animals) Someone who is sexually attracted to members of one or more genders."}]}]},"mandarins":{"h":"mandarins","l":"mandarin","q":"noun"},"horrider":{"h":"horrider","l":"horrid","q":"adjective"},"horridest":{"h":"horridest","l":"horrid","q":"adjective"},"laconic":{"h":"laconic","i":"/ləˈkɒnɪk/","a":"en-us-laconic.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If someone or something is laconic, they only speak with a few words."}]}]},"blandish":{"h":"blandish","i":"/ˈblændɪʃ/","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"To blandish someone is to try to convince them of something by telling them nice things.","e":"The salesman blandished me, to sell me an expensive car."}]}]},"blandishes":{"h":"blandishes","l":"blandish","q":"verb"},"blandished":{"h":"blandished","l":"blandish","q":"verb"},"blandishing":{"h":"blandishing","l":"blandish","q":"verb"},"imitation":{"h":"imitation","i":"/ɪmɪˈteɪʃən/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-imitation.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Imitation is the act of."},{"m":"(countable) An imitation of 