 is not admissible."},{"m":"What is inadmissible cannot be allowed as evidence in a criminal trial."}]}]},"disagreeably":{"h":"disagreeably","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is happening in a manner that is disagreeably unpleasant, or if a person is behaving in a disagreeably unpleasant way, that things are not happening in an agreeable way."}]}]},"advertizement":{"h":"advertizement","i":"/ədˈvɜːtɪsmənt/","a":"en-us-advertisement.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Advertizement is an alternative spelling of advertisement, a public notice which advertises something; pictures and writing from a company which many people can see.","e":"There was an advertisement for fruit on the wall. It had a big picture of an apple."}]}]},"advertizements":{"h":"advertizements","l":"advertizement","q":"noun"},"admittance":{"h":"admittance","i":"/ədˈmɪt.n̩s/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-admittance.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Admittance is when something is admitted to."},{"m":"Admittance is the action of admitting someone into your school, company, etc."}]}]},"admittances":{"h":"admittances","l":"admittance","q":"noun"},"affectation":{"h":"affectation","i":"/ˌæf.ɛkˈteɪ.ʃən/","a":"en-us-affectation.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Affectation is an attempt to assume or exhibit what is not natural or real; false display; artificial show."}]}]},"affectations":{"h":"affectations","l":"affectation","q":"noun"},"readmit":{"h":"readmit","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If a person readmits, he admits something again after already having done so."},{"m":"If a person is readmitted, he is allowed to come back to a school, company, etc. after having left the group."}]}]},"readmits":{"h":"readmits","l":"readmit","q":"verb"},"readmitted":{"h":"readmitted","l":"readmit","q":"verb"},"readmitting":{"h":"readmitting","l":"readmit","q":"verb"},"advertizer":{"h":"advertizer","i":"/ˈædvə(r)ˌtaɪzə(r)/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-advertiser.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An advertiz