gs, such as a room."}]}]},"woodworker":{"h":"woodworker","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A woodworker is a worker who makes woodwork."}]}]},"rooks":{"h":"rooks","l":"rook","q":"noun"},"impervious":{"h":"impervious","i":"/ɪmpɜviɛs/","a":"en-us-impervious.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If someone or something is impervious to something, they are unable to be affected by it."}]}]},"milkshake":{"h":"milkshake","i":"[ˈmɪɫk.ʃeɪk]","a":"en-us-milkshake.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A milkshake is thick drink made from milk and ice cream mixed together, sometimes with added fruit, chocolate, or flavored syrups.","e":"I got a mint-chocolate milkshake on the way home."}]}]},"milkshakes":{"h":"milkshakes","l":"milkshake","q":"noun"},"diversion":{"h":"diversion","i":"/dɪˈvɝʒən/","a":"En-us-diversion.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(military) A diversion is a tactic used to draw attention away from the real threat or action."}]}]},"frugal":{"h":"frugal","i":"/ˈfruːɡəl/","a":"en-us-frugal.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If you are frugal, you avoid spending more money than necessary.","e":"Lydia is skilled at being a frugal shopper."}]}]},"shopper":{"h":"shopper","i":"/ˈʃɒp.ə/","a":"en-us-shopper.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A shopper is someone who is shopping or who shops.","e":"Attention all shoppers, the store will be closing in 10 minutes."}]}]},"shoppers":{"h":"shoppers","l":"shopper","q":"noun"},"icy":{"h":"icy","i":"/ˈaɪsi/","a":"en-us-icy.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is icy it is covered with ice.","e":"Be careful, the sidewalk is icy."}]}]},"barefoot":{"h":"barefoot","i":"/ˈbɛəfʊt/","a":"en-us-barefoot.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If you are barefoot, you are not wearing anything on your feet.","e":"Almost everyone is barefoot at the beach."}]}]},"triple":{"h":"triple","i":"/ˈtripəl/","a":"en-us-triple.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is triple, it is 200% bigger than something else.","e":"The new computer was triple the cost of the old one."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you triple something, you multiply it by three.","e":"Julia tripled her income by working hard and becoming the manager."},{"m":"(intransitive) If something triples, it grows by 200%.","e":"Julia's income tripled when she became the manager."}]}]},"download":{"h":"download","i":"/ˈdaʊnˌləʊd/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-download.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you download something, you transfer it from a remote computer to the one you are using with an internet connection.","e":"Mark is downloading a large file and has to be patient."},{"m":"(intransitive) If something is downloading, it is transferring from one computer to another using an internet connection.","e":"\"This huge file is downloading too slowly\" Mark complained."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A download is the act of downloading a file or the file that is downloaded.","e":"Mark was very happy when the download finally completed."}]}]},"lengthen":{"h":"lengthen","i":"/ˈlɛŋ(k)θən/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-lengthen.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you lengthen something, you make it longer in length or duration."},{"m":"(intransitive) If something lengthens, it becomes longer in length or duration."}]}]},"upload":{"h":"upload","i":"/əpˈləʊd/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-upload.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you upload something, you transfer it from the computer you are using to a remote computer with an internet connection.","e":"I tried to upload the image, but I got an error."},{"m":"(intransitive) If something is uploading, it is transferring from one computer to another using an internet connection.","e":"Seth got some coffee while his file was uploading."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An upload is the act of uploading a file or the file that is uploaded.","e":"I can't believe the upload failed again!"}]}]},"spillage":{"