 mostly for their fiberous stalks.","e":"I grow celery in my garden."}]}]},"downloads":{"h":"downloads","l":"download","q":"noun"},"downloading":{"h":"downloading","i":"/ˈdaʊnloʊdɪŋ/","l":"download","q":"verb"},"downloaded":{"h":"downloaded","l":"download","q":"verb"},"screwdriver":{"h":"screwdriver","i":"/ˈskruːdraɪvɚ/","a":"en-us-screwdriver.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A screwdriver is a tool used for twisting screws to make them go into or come out of something.","e":"I need a screwdriver to take out these screws."},{"m":"(countable) A screwdriver is a cocktail made of vodka and orange juice."}]}]},"screwdrivers":{"h":"screwdrivers","l":"screwdriver","q":"noun"},"helmet":{"h":"helmet","i":"/ˈhɛlmɪt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Benoît Prieur-helmet.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A helmet is a type of hat that protects a person's head.","e":"Always remember to put your helmet on."}]}]},"fingernail":{"h":"fingernail","i":"/ˈfɪŋɡɚˌneɪl/","a":"En-us-fingernail.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A fingernail is the thick, hard part at the end of a finger.","e":"I better trim my fingernails before they get too long."}]}]},"defecate":{"h":"defecate","i":"/dɛfɪkeɪt/","a":"en-us-defecate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If a person or animal defecates, they get rid of feces from the anus.","e":"Please go to the toilet if you need to defecate."}]}]},"flatulence":{"h":"flatulence","i":"/ˈflæt͡ʃələns/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-flatulence.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Flatulence is gas that comes out of the anus."}]}]},"graze":{"h":"graze","i":"/ɡreɪz/","a":"en-us-graze.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A graze is a slight scratch.","e":"\"How did you get a graze on your elbow?\" the mother asked her child."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"When animals graze, they eat grass in a meadow or field.","e":"The cattle graze in the meadow."},{"m":"If you graze something, you give it a light scratch.","e":"I accidentally grazed the wall because I wasn't careful moving the table."}]}]},"automate":{"h":"automate","i":"/ˈɔtoʊˌmeɪt/","a":"en-us-automate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you automate a process, you make it automatic, for example work done by machines instead of humans.","e":"Automating the assembly process will increase our output."}]}]},"workflow":{"h":"workflow","i":"/ˈwɜːkfləʊ/","a":"en-us-workflow.oga","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A workflow is a process followed in order to complete work tasks.","e":"Our workflow needs to be optimized."}]}]},"optimize":{"h":"optimize","i":"/ˈɑptɪmaɪz/","a":"en-us-optimize.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you optimize something, you make it the best that it can be, or the most efficient that it can be.","e":"My job is to optimize the software code."}]}]},"conductors":{"h":"conductors","l":"conductor","q":"noun"},"burp":{"h":"burp","i":"/bɝp/","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you burp, you noisily get rid of gas from your stomach and out of your mouth.","e":"Burping at the dinner table is rude."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A burp is the action or the sound of getting rid of gas from your stomach and out of your mouth.","e":"Albert let out a loud burp."}]}]},"vulva":{"h":"vulva","i":"/ˈvʌlvə/","a":"en-us-vulva.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) The vulva is the external sexual organ of the female."}]}]},"profanity":{"h":"profanity","i":"/prəˈfanɪti/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-profanity.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Profanity is swear words.","e":"Please do not use profanity while children are around."},{"m":"(uncountable) Profanity is an act disrespecting a religion or religious belief."}]}]},"depower":{"h":"depower","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you depower somebody or something, you remove its power.","e":"Kryptonite depowers Superman."}]}]},"laos":{"h":"Laos","i":"/ˈlaʊs/","a":"en-us-Laos.ogg","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Laos is a country in Southeast Asia. Its capital city is Vientiane."}]}]},"cambodia":{"h":"Cambodia","i":"[kæm'boʊdiə