ant. It has long and curved tusks and a hairy body."}]}]},"mammoths":{"h":"mammoths","l":"mammoth","q":"noun"},"panorama":{"h":"panorama","i":"/ˌpæ.nəˈræ.mə/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-panorama.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A panorama is a wide-angle view of an area."}]}]},"panoramas":{"h":"panoramas","l":"panorama","q":"noun"},"panoramata":{"h":"panoramata","l":"panorama","q":"noun"},"courtyard":{"h":"courtyard","i":"/ˈkɔrt.jɑrd/","a":"en-us-courtyard.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A courtyard is a space inside a building that is open to the sky. It can be partially or completely surrounded by walls or buildings."}]}]},"courtyards":{"h":"courtyards","l":"courtyard","q":"noun"},"wireless":{"h":"wireless","i":"/ˈwaɪ.ə(r).ləs/","a":"en-us-wireless.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"A device, computer, etc. that is wireless does not have any wires, or communicates without using wires.","e":"The newest technology is increasingly wireless now."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Wireless is way to be connected to a computer network.","e":"If your wireless stops working, try restarting the router."}]}]},"vaccinate":{"h":"vaccinate","i":"/ˈvæksɪneɪt/","a":"en-us-vaccinate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If someone is vaccinated, they are given a vaccine to stop them from getting a disease or illness.","e":"Doctors usually recommend that people are vaccinated against the flu every year."}]}]},"vaccinates":{"h":"vaccinates","l":"vaccinate","q":"verb"},"vaccinating":{"h":"vaccinating","l":"vaccinate","q":"verb"},"vaccinated":{"h":"vaccinated","l":"vaccinate","q":"verb"},"vaccination":{"h":"vaccination","i":"/ˌvæk.sɪˈneɪ.ʃən/","a":"en-us-vaccination.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A vaccination is when someone is given a vaccine to protect them from a certain disease or illness.","e":"Vaccination rates around the world have been going up."}]}]},"vaccinations":{"h":"vaccinations","l":"vaccination","q":"noun"},"excavate":{"h