 can be sorted."}]}]},"unsortable":{"h":"unsortable","i":"/ʌnˈsɔːtəb(ə)l/","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is unsortable, it cannot be sorted."}]}]},"mushy":{"h":"mushy","i":"/ˈmʌʃi/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-mushy.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is mushy, it is soft and does not have a firm shape."},{"m":"If the conversation between two people is mushy, it is excessively emotional."}]}]},"mushier":{"h":"mushier","l":"mushy","q":"adjective"},"mushiest":{"h":"mushiest","l":"mushy","q":"adjective"},"corny":{"h":"corny","i":"/ˈkɔːni/","a":"en-au-corny.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is corny, it is too dramatic or sentimental.","e":"The movie was okay, but the love scene was really corny."}]}]},"cornier":{"h":"cornier","l":"corny","q":"adjective"},"corniest":{"h":"corniest","l":"corny","q":"adjective"},"hackneyed":{"h":"hackneyed","i":"/ˈhækniːd/","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is hackneyed, it is overused and not original."}]}]},"bustle":{"h":"bustle","i":"/ˈbʌsəl/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bustle.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A bustle is an excited activity."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you bustle, you move in an energetic way.","e":"The commuters bustled about inside the train station."}]}]},"bustles":{"h":"bustles","l":"bustle","q":"noun"},"bustled":{"h":"bustled","l":"bustle","q":"verb"},"bustling":{"h":"bustling","i":"/ˈbʌslɪŋ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bustling.wav","l":"bustle","q":"verb","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If a place is bustling, it is very busy and has a lot of activity."}]}]},"carbonated":{"h":"carbonated","i":"/ˈkɑː(r)bɒneɪtəd/","a":"en-us-carbonated.ogg","l":"carbonate","q":"verb","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If a liquid is carbonated, it contains dissolved gas.","e":"are carbonated drinks. and beer are naturally carbonated through fermentation."}]}]},"slump":{"h":"slump","i":"/slʌmp/","a":"en-au-slump.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If a person slumps, they sit or lean heavily."},{"m":"(transitive) If the value of something slumps, its price falls suddenly.","e":"Real estate prices slumped during the recession."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A slump is a sudden fall of something, especially for an extended period."}]}]},"slumps":{"h":"slumps","l":"slump","q":"verb"},"slumped":{"h":"slumped","l":"slump","q":"verb"},"slumping":{"h":"slumping","l":"slump","q":"verb"},"trek":{"h":"trek","i":"/trɛk/","a":"en-us-trek.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A trek is a slow or difficult journey.","e":"We're planning a trek up."},{"m":"A trek is a long walk.","e":"I would drive to the shops from here; you can walk, but it's quite a trek."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you trek, you go on a slow or arduous journey."}]}]},"treks":{"h":"treks","l":"trek","q":"noun"},"trekked":{"h":"trekked","l":"trek","q":"verb"},"trekking":{"h":"trekking","l":"trek","q":"verb"},"arduous":{"h":"arduous","i":"/ˈɑːdjuːəs/","a":"en-us-arduous.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If a something is arduous, it requires or uses up a lot of energy to do it."}]}]},"commentary":{"h":"commentary","i":"/ˈkɒm.ən.tə.ri/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-commentary.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A commentary is a series of comments about an event.","e":"We listened to the football commentary while watching the match."}]}]},"commentaries":{"h":"commentaries","l":"commentary","q":"noun"},"chastise":{"h":"chastise","i":"/tʃæˈstaɪz/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-chastise.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you chastise someone, you scold or punish them severely."}]}]},"chastises":{"h":"chastises","l":"chastise","q":"verb"},"chastised":{"h":"chastised","l":"chastise","q":"verb"},"chastising":{"h":"chastising","l":"chastise","q":"verb"},"severely":{"h":"severely","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-severely.wav","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is done severely, it is done in a strict manner."}]}]},"celibate":{"h":"celibate","i":"/ˈsɛ