pearance of something."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A cosmetic is any substances that is applied externally to improve the color or texture of the skin","e":"lipstick, eyeshadow, eyeliner; makeup"}]}]},"cosmetics":{"h":"cosmetics","l":"cosmetic","q":"noun","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Cosmetics is the preparations applied to enhance the beauty of skin, hair, etc."}]}]},"makeup":{"h":"makeup","i":"/ˈmeɪkʌp/","a":"en-us-makeup.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"The makeup of something is what the item contains or made of.","e":"To understand how a nuclear reactor works, we must first look at its makeup."},{"m":"Makeup is cosmetics that is used to alter the appearance of a person's skin."}]}]},"makeups":{"h":"makeups","l":"makeup","q":"noun"},"eyeliner":{"h":"eyeliner","i":"/ˈʌɪlʌɪnə/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Eyeliner is a cosmetic that is used to outline the eye."}]}]},"eyeshadow":{"h":"eyeshadow","i":"/ˈʌɪʃadəʊ/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Eyeshadow is a cosmetic that is used applied to the eyelids to give a darker complexion."}]}]},"eyeliners":{"h":"eyeliners","l":"eyeliner","q":"noun"},"eyeshadows":{"h":"eyeshadows","l":"eyeshadow","q":"noun"},"complexion":{"h":"complexion","i":"/kəmˈplɛkʃən/","a":"en-us-complexion.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) Complexion is the quality, colour, or appearance of a person's skin."}]}]},"complexions":{"h":"complexions","l":"complexion","q":"noun"},"brutalize":{"h":"brutalize","i":"/ˈbruːt(ə)lʌɪz/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-brutalise.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you brutalize, you inflict brutal violence on something or someone."}]}]},"brutalizes":{"h":"brutalizes","l":"brutalize","q":"verb"},"brutalized":{"h":"brutalized","l":"brutalize","q":"verb"},"brutalizing":{"h":"brutalizing","l":"brutalize","q":"verb"},"brutalise":{"h":"brutalise","i":"/ˈbruːt(ə)lʌɪz/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-brutalise.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you brutalise, you inflict brutal violence on something or someone."}]}]},"brutalises":{"h":"brutalises","l":"brutalise","q":"verb"},"brutalised":{"h":"brutalised","l":"brutalise","q":"verb"},"brutalising":{"h":"brutalising","l":"brutalise","q":"verb"},"love-bomb":{"h":"love-bomb","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Naomi Persephone Amethyst (NaomiAmethyst)-love-bomb.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A love-bomb is an instance of giving someone a lot of attention so as to influence them about something."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you love-bomb someone, you give someone a lot of attention so as to influence them about something.","e":"Her neighbour love-bombed her whenever she needed to hitch a hike somewhere."}]}]},"gaslight":{"h":"gaslight","i":"/ˈɡæslaɪt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-I learned some phrases-gaslight.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you gaslight someone, you try to make them doubt their own reality.","e":"Her mother gaslighted her daughter out of narcissistic impulses."}]}]},"gaslights":{"h":"gaslights","l":"gaslight","q":"verb"},"gaslighted":{"h":"gaslighted","l":"gaslight","q":"verb"},"gaslit":{"h":"gaslit","l":"gaslight","q":"verb"},"gaslighting":{"h":"gaslighting","l":"gaslight","q":"verb"},"love-bombs":{"h":"love-bombs","l":"love-bomb","q":"noun"},"love-bombed":{"h":"love-bombed","l":"love-bomb","q":"verb"},"love-bombing":{"h":"love-bombing","l":"love-bomb","q":"verb"},"secondary":{"h":"secondary","i":"/ˈsɛkənd(ə)rɪ/","a":"en-us-secondary.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"second, next in order to the first or primary.","e":"After finishing elementary school, he went to secondary school."},{"m":"of less than primary importance.","e":"These things come before that because it's only secondary."}]}]},"tertiary":{"h":"tertiary","i":"/ˈtɜː.ʃi.ə.riː/","a":"en-us-tertiary.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"of third rank or order; subsequent.","e":"College in the US is a tertiary institution. It comes after high school."}]}]},"trot":{"h":"trot","i":"/trɑt/","a":"en-au-trot.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(intransitive) to run slowly; to jog.","e":"I'll trot down to the store and buy some."},{"m":"(transitive) to cause an animal (usually a horse) to move at a trot, faster than a walk, slower than a canter.","e":"She trotted her horse up next to his."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) a slow run; a jog.","e":"They put their horses into a trot."}]}]},"citron":{"h":"citron","i":"/ˈsɪtrən/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-citron.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Citron is a color mixing yellow and green","e":"He had his house painted citron."},{"m":"(countable) Citron is a small tree that has citrus fruit. The scientific name is.","e":"Hannah has a citron growing in her backyard."},{"m":"(countable) Citron is a fruit of a citron tree.","e":"She ate a citron with her lunch today."},{"m":"(countable) Citron is the candied rind of the fruit."}]}]},"citrons":{"h":"citrons","l":"citron","q":"noun"},"glycerin":{"h":"glycerin","i":"/ˈɡlɪsərɪn/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Glycerin is a sweet byproduct of making soap. This chemical is also called glycerol, or. It has many uses."}]}]},"glycerins":{"h":"glycerins","l":"glycerin","q":"noun"},"hysteria":{"h":"hysteria","i":"/hɨˈstɛrijə/","a":"en-us-hysteria.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) A person with hysteria acts showing too much emotion like fear or panic.","e":"We know you're afraid, but don't give in to hysteria."},{"m":"(uncountable) Hysteria is a problem in the mind making the person excitable with no natural cause.","e":"Ray was diagnosed with hysteria."}]}]},"trots":{"h":"trots","l":"trot","q":"verb"},"trotted":{"h":"trotted","l":"trot","q":"verb"},"trotting":{"h":"trotting","l":"trot","q":"verb"},"jersey":{"h":"jersey","i":"/ˈdʒɜːzi/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-jersey.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A jersey is a piece of clothing for the upper body made of wool."},{"m":"(countable) A jersey is a kind of uniform for sports.","e":"The player put on his jersey and ran onto the field."},{"m":"(uncountable) Jersey is a kind of fabric knit."}]}]},"jerseys":{"h":"jerseys","l":"jersey","q":"noun"},"adventist":{"h":"Adventist","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) An Adventist is a person who believes in the Second Advent (or Second Coming) of Jesus."},{"m":"(countable) (short form) An Adventist is a member of the Seventh-day Adventist Church."}]},{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"An Adventist thing is a thing related to believers in the Second Advent of Jesus or related to Adventism."},{"m":"An Adventist thing is a thing related to the Seventh-day Adventist Church."}]}]},"adventists":{"h":"Adventists","l":"adventist","q":"noun"},"placate":{"h":"placate","i":"/pləˈkeɪt/","a":"en-us-placate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you placate a person, you calm them down by making them less angry."}]}]},"placates":{"h":"placates","l":"placate","q":"verb"},"placated":{"h":"placated","l":"placate","q":"verb"},"placating":{"h":"placating","l":"placate","q":"verb"},"ellipses":{"h":"ellipses","l":"ellipsis","q":"noun"},"vicarious":{"h":"vicarious","i":"/vɪˈkɛəri.əs/","a":"en-us-vicarious.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is vicarious, it gives someone an experience through imagination without them actually doing a task."}]}]},"codependency":{"h":"codependency","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Codependency is when you emotionally submissive in response to someone's harmful behaviour; being an emotional doormat","e":"Her codependency meant she gave in to most narcissists."}]}]},"doormat":{"h":"doormat","i":"/ˈdɔːˌmæt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-doormat.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A doormat is someone who lets others dominate or use them."},{"m":"(countable) A mat placed on a doorway."}]}]},"codependence":{"h":"codependence","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) If you have codependence, you put the needs of others before yourself; an emotional inclination to being subordinat