 enmesh something, you entangle and interweave it, usually in the appearance of a net."}]}]},"enmeshments":{"h":"enmeshments","l":"enmeshment","q":"noun"},"enmeshes":{"h":"enmeshes","l":"enmesh","q":"verb"},"enmeshed":{"h":"enmeshed","l":"enmesh","q":"verb"},"enmeshing":{"h":"enmeshing","l":"enmesh","q":"verb"},"triangulate":{"h":"triangulate","i":"/traɪˈæŋɡjəleɪt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-triangulate.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you triangulate an area, you try to find something by forming a triangle."},{"m":"(transitive) If you triangulate someone, you manipulatively bring a third person into the relationship to keep control.","e":"He got triangulated by his mother via his aunts and uncles."}]}]},"projection":{"h":"projection","i":"/prəˈdʒɛkʃən/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-projection.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A projection is when something juts out."},{"m":"(countable) A projection is display from an electronic device such as a movie projector"},{"m":"(countable) A projection is when someone assumes other people have the same thoughts as themselves"},{"m":"(by extension) Projection is when you externalize your own negative traits onto someone else","e":"Her accusation of animal abuse onto Suzie, was simply a projection of her own sadism towards animals."}]}]},"gaslighter":{"h":"gaslighter","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A gaslighter is someone who lights gas."},{"m":"(countable) A gaslighter is someone who gaslights. Usually this means someone who makes others doubt their own reality or sanity."}]}]},"confelicity":{"h":"confelicity","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Confelicity is the state of being vicariously happy at another person's joy or well-being."}]}]},"gaslighters":{"h":"gaslighters","l":"gaslighter","q":"noun"},"projections":{"h":"projections","l":"projection","q":"noun"},"triangulates":{"h":"triangulates","l":"triangulate","q":"verb"},"triangulated":{"h":"triangulated","l":"triangulate","q":"verb"},"triangulating":{"