 snuff, you inhale through the nose."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A snuff is powdered tobacco that is inhaled through the nose."},{"m":"A snuff is the charred part of a candle wick."}]}]},"snuffs":{"h":"snuffs","l":"snuff","q":"verb"},"snuffed":{"h":"snuffed","l":"snuff","q":"verb"},"snuffing":{"h":"snuffing","l":"snuff","q":"verb"},"squire":{"h":"squire","i":"/ˈskwaɪə/","a":"en-us-squire.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A squire is a shield-bearer or armor-bearer of a knight."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If you squire, you accompany or escort someone"}]}]},"squires":{"h":"squires","l":"squire","q":"noun"},"squired":{"h":"squired","l":"squire","q":"verb"},"squiring":{"h":"squiring","l":"squire","q":"verb"},"imoinu":{"h":"Imoinu","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Imoinu is an ancient Meitei goddess of family, fireplace, hearth, household, kitchen, peace, prosperity and wealth."},{"m":"Imoinu is a female given name from Meitei language."}]}]},"atingkok":{"h":"Atingkok","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Atingkok is an ancient Meitei God of creation of the universe."}]}]},"haoreima":{"h":"Haoreima","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Haoreima is an ancient Meitei goddess of diseases, illnesses, souls and spirits."},{"m":"Haoreima is a female given name from Meitei language."}]}]},"khamlangba":{"h":"Khamlangba","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Khamlangba is an ancient Meitei God of iron, mining, metallurgy, steel manufacturing, hunting and war."},{"m":"Khamlangba is a male given name from Meitei language."}]}]},"khoriphaba":{"h":"Khoriphaba","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Khoriphaba is an ancient Meitei God of wrestling. He is the son of sky God Salailen."},{"m":"Khoriphaba is a male given name from Meitei language."}]}]},"salailen":{"h":"Salailen","s":[{"p":"proper noun","d":[{"m":"Salailen is an ancient Meitei God of sky and heaven. He is the king of all gods."},{"m":"Salailen is a male given name from Meitei language."}]}]},"korouhanba":{"h