eting where different people give lectures about different topics.","e":"This colloquium is held every Tuesday to talk about new research."}]}]},"colloquia":{"h":"colloquia","l":"colloquium","q":"noun"},"colloquiums":{"h":"colloquiums","l":"colloquium","q":"noun"},"diver":{"h":"diver","i":"/ˈdaɪ̯vər/","a":"en-au-diver.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A diver is a person who dives.","e":"A competitive diver spins in mid-air before they dive into the water."}]}]},"divers":{"h":"divers","l":"diver","q":"noun"},"coldly":{"h":"coldly","i":"/ˈkoʊldli/","a":"en-us-coldly.ogg","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"With a low temperature."},{"m":"Without emotion."},{"m":"Not acting like a friend or a lover."}]}]},"superannuate":{"h":"superannuate","i":"/ˌsuːpərˈænjueɪt/","a":"en-au-superannuate.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(transitive) If a person superannuates, they retire due to their age."}]}]},"superannuates":{"h":"superannuates","l":"superannuate","q":"verb"},"superannuated":{"h":"superannuated","l":"superannuate","q":"verb"},"superannuating":{"h":"superannuating","l":"superannuate","q":"verb"},"pee-pee":{"h":"pee-pee","i":"/ˈpiːpiː/","a":"en-au-pee-pee.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Pee-pee is another name of urine."},{"m":"Pee-pee is another name of the penis or vagina."}]}]},"pee-pees":{"h":"pee-pees","l":"pee-pee","q":"noun"},"lambaste":{"h":"lambaste","i":"/læmˈbeɪst/","a":"en-us-lambaste.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you lambaste a person, you scold or reprimand them in a harsh way."}]}]},"lambast":{"h":"lambast","i":"/læmˈbeɪst/","a":"en-us-lambaste.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you lambast a person, you scold or reprimand them in a harsh way."}]}]},"lambasts":{"h":"lambasts","l":"lambast","q":"verb"},"lambasted":{"h":"lambasted","l":"lambast","q":"verb"},"lambasting":{"h":"lambasting","l":"lambast","q":"verb"},"lambastes":{"h":"lambastes","l":"lambaste","q":"verb"},"chiffonade":{"h":"chiffonade","i":"/ʃɪfəˈnɑːd/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhur