alse impression to someone."}]}]},"illudes":{"h":"illudes","l":"illude","q":"verb"},"illuded":{"h":"illuded","l":"illude","q":"verb"},"illuding":{"h":"illuding","l":"illude","q":"verb"},"quattuordecillions":{"h":"quattuordecillions","l":"quattuordecillion","q":"noun"},"quintillions":{"h":"quintillions","l":"quintillion","q":"noun"},"quadrillions":{"h":"quadrillions","l":"quadrillion","q":"noun"},"vigintillions":{"h":"vigintillions","l":"vigintillion","q":"noun"},"twenty-six":{"h":"twenty-six","i":"/ˌtwɛntiˈsɪks/","s":[{"p":"determiner","d":[{"m":"(ordinal: twenty-sixth) The number 26.","e":"He is twenty-six years old."}]}]},"twenty-seven":{"h":"twenty-seven","i":"/ˌtwɛntiˈsɛvən/","s":[{"p":"determiner","d":[{"m":"(ordinal: twenty-seventh) The number 27.","e":"He is twenty-seven years old."}]}]},"twenty-eight":{"h":"twenty-eight","i":"/ˌtwɛntiˈeɪt/","s":[{"p":"determiner","d":[{"m":"(ordinal: twenty-eightth) The number 28.","e":"He is twenty-eight years old."}]}]},"twenty-nine":{"h":"twenty-nine","i":"/ˌtwɛntiˈnaɪn/","s":[{"p":"determiner","d":[{"m":"(ordinal: twenty-nineth) The number 29.","e":"He is twenty-nine years old."}]}]},"metamour":{"h":"metamour","i":"/ˈmɛtəmʊə(r)/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Naomi Persephone Amethyst (NaomiAmethyst)-metamour.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"In a polyamorous relationship, a metamour is your partner's partner, with whom you are not dating.","e":"Billy and Jamie are dating, Jamie is dating Tom, but Billy and Tom are not dating. Because they are both dating the same person but not dating each other, they are metamours."}]}]},"metamours":{"h":"metamours","l":"metamour","q":"noun"},"cryptozoology":{"h":"cryptozoology","i":"/ˌkrɪp.təʊ.zəʊˈɒ.lə.d͡ʒi/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Cryptozoology is the search for animals, especially mythical ones, to see if they might really exist."}]}]},"sensitivity":{"h":"sensitivity","i":"/ˌsɛnsɪˈtɪvɪti/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-sensitivity.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"The sensitivity of something is how sensitive it is."}]}]},"sensitivities":{"h":"sensitivities","l":"sensitivity","q":"noun"},"firmly":{"h":"firmly","i":"/fɝmli/","a":"en-us-firmly.ogg","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If you do something firmly, you do it in a firm or strong way."},{"m":"If A is firmly attached onto B, A is attached to B in a secured way."}]}]},"firmlier":{"h":"firmlier","l":"firmly","q":"adverb"},"firmliest":{"h":"firmliest","l":"firmly","q":"adverb"},"commander":{"h":"commander","i":"/kəˈmændɚ/","a":"en-us-commander.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A commander is a person who controls and directs an organization.","e":"The new commander of the Naval Fleet will be taking over next week."}]}]},"commanders":{"h":"commanders","l":"commander","q":"noun"},"commandant":{"h":"commandant","i":"/ˈkɒməndænt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-commandant.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A commandant is a military officer who commands a specific unit or division."}]}]},"commandants":{"h":"commandants","l":"commandant","q":"noun"},"militaria":{"h":"militaria","i":"/ˌmɪlɪˈtɛːrɪə/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-militaria.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Militaria are military or police artifacts."}]}]},"militant":{"h":"militant","i":"/ˈmɪlɪtənt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-militant.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"A militant person is someone who favours fighting to show that they support a political or social cause."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A militant is someone who is aggressive for a particular cause."}]}]},"militants":{"h":"militants","l":"militant","q":"noun"},"goodwill":{"h":"goodwill","i":"/ɡʊdˈwɪl/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-goodwill.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) Goodwill is the friendly and helpful attitude towards someone or something.","e":"s should be done out of goodwill."},{"m":"(accounting) Goodwill is the reputation of a business that can be as an asset when the business is sold.","e":"The accountants valued the company's goodwill at 14 million dollars."}]}]},"quantify":{"h":"quantify","i":"/ˈkwɑːn.tə.faɪ/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-quantify.wav","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you quantify something, you assign a quantity to it.","e":"It's difficult to quantify the students' progress."},{"m":"If you quantify something, you determine its value.","e":"There are real benefits from maintenance that we can quantify."}]}]},"quantifies":{"h":"quantifies","l":"quantify","q":"verb"},"quantified":{"h":"quantified","l":"quantify","q":"verb"},"quantifying":{"h":"quantifying","l":"quantify","q":"verb"},"refusal":{"h":"refusal","i":"/rɪˈfjuːzl̩/","a":"en-us-refusal.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A refusal to a request, offer, invitation, or command, is saying no to it.","e":"Your refusal to do your job resulted in your being fired."},{"m":"A refusal to do something is also when you are not willing to do it.","e":"Her refusal to participate was clear when she stayed in her seat."}]}]},"refusals":{"h":"refusals","l":"refusal","q":"noun"},"significance":{"h":"significance","i":"/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns/","a":"en-us-significance.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(uncountable) The significance of something is how important or large its effect or influence is.","e":"The significance of the discovery was not well understood at the time."},{"m":"(uncountable) The significance of a word, sign, action etc, is its meaning.","e":"The significance of her words was clear."}]}]},"publicly":{"h":"publicly","i":"/ˈpʌblɪkli/","a":"en-us-publicly.ogg","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is done publicly, it is done in public.","e":"He publicly proposed to his girlfriend."}]}]},"intensive":{"h":"intensive","i":"/ɪnˈtɛnsɪv/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-intensive.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something like a task is intensive, it requires a lot of work without a lot of time.","e":"Before going to Italy, he took an intensive Italian language course."}]}]},"evenly":{"h":"evenly","i":"/ˈiːvənli/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-evenly.wav","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is evenly spread, it is spread out as to form a flat surface.","e":"Spread the icing evenly over the cake."},{"m":"If you distribute something evenly, you give the same amount of it to everyone.","e":"To avoid arguments, he divided the sweets evenly between his two children."},{"m":"If a number is evenly divisible, it can be divided to leave no remainder."}]}]},"honestly":{"h":"honestly","i":"/ˈɑnɪstli/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-honestly.wav","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If you do something honestly, you do it in an honest manner.","e":"He answered the questions honestly."},{"m":"Honestly is used to emphasize the opinion of a person.","e":"Honestly, I didn't believe a word she said."}]}]},"proximity":{"h":"proximity","i":"/prɑkˈsɪ.mɪ.ti/","a":"en-us-proximity.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"If something is in close proximity, it is very near.","e":"The proximity of the heat source allowed it to be detected by the sensor."}]}]},"proximities":{"h":"proximities","l":"proximity","q":"noun"},"pistol":{"h":"pistol","i":"/ˈpɪstəl/","a":"en-us-pistol.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A pistol is a small handgun."}]}]},"pistols":{"h":"pistols","l":"pistol","q":"noun"},"handgun":{"h":"handgun","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) A handgun is a small gun that is designed to be held and operated with one hand.","e":"A pistol is a type of handgun."}]}]},"handguns":{"h":"handguns","l":"handgun","q":"noun"},"tolerant":{"h":"tolerant","i":"/ˈtɒlərənt/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-tolerant.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If a person is tolerant, they allow, understand, or accept something to a large extent."}]}]},"leukaemia":{"h":"leukaemia","i":"/luˈkimiə/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-leukemia.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":", (uncountable) Leukaemia is a cancer of the blood or bone marrow where you have too many blood cells (usually white blood cells)."},{"m":", (countable) 