ht summery dress."}]}]},"summerier":{"h":"summerier","l":"summery","q":"adjective"},"summeriest":{"h":"summeriest","l":"summery","q":"adjective"},"enquiry":{"h":"enquiry","i":"/ɪnˈkwaɪə.ri/","a":"en-uk-enquiry.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) (British, Australia, New Zealand) An enquiry is a question."},{"m":"(uncountable) An enquiry is a search for the truth or for more information about a topic."}]}]},"enquiries":{"h":"enquiries","l":"enquiry","q":"noun"},"elasticity":{"h":"elasticity","i":"/ɪ.læsˈtɪs.ɪ.ti/","a":"en-us-elasticity.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"The elasticity of something is how elastic the thing is."},{"m":"The elasticity is the property of a material that is deformed under load can regain its original shape and size when unloaded."},{"m":"The elasticity of A is how sensitive its quantity changes when B changes in another quantity."}]}]},"elasticities":{"h":"elasticities","l":"elasticity","q":"noun"},"brightly":{"h":"brightly","i":"/ˈbraɪtli/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-brightly.wav","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is brightly, it is giving off a lot of light."},{"m":"If you speak, smile, or act brightly, you do so in a happy, positive, friendly way."}]}]},"occupancy":{"h":"occupancy","i":"/ˈɒkjəpənsi/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-occupancy.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Occupancy is the act of occupying a place as an occupant or tenant."},{"m":"Occupancy is the time period of which someone occupies a piece of land or premises."},{"m":"The occupancy of a building is how much of the building is occupied by tenants.","e":"The average occupancy of this hotel is 90 percent."}]}]},"occupancies":{"h":"occupancies","l":"occupancy","q":"noun"},"floppy":{"h":"floppy","i":"/ˈflɒ.pi/","a":"en-us-floppy.ogg","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If a long or flat object is floppy, it bends easily without breaking."}]}]},"floppier":{"h":"floppier","l":"floppy","q":"adjective"},"floppiest":{"h":"floppiest","l":"floppy","q":"adjective"}