 of speeches as an exercise in schools and colleges."},{"m":"A set or harangue; declamatory discourse."},{"m":"Pretentious rhetorica display, with more sound than sense.","e":"mere declamation"}]}]},"declamations":{"h":"declamations","l":"declamation","q":"noun"},"jade":{"h":"jade","i":"/d͡ʒeɪd/","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Jade is a hard, typically green stone used in jewelry and ornaments.","e":"She wore a necklace made of jade, which matched the color of her eyes perfectly."},{"m":"Jade is a slightly bluish or greyish green colour, similar to polished jade stones.","e":"Today she wore a jade dress."},{"m":"Jade is a succulent plant ()."}]}]},"jades":{"h":"jades","l":"jade","q":"noun"},"deeply":{"h":"deeply","i":"/ˈdiːpli/","a":"en-us-deeply.ogg","s":[{"p":"adverb","d":[{"m":"If something is deeply rooted, felt, held, etc., it is done to a deep extent or degree.","e":"I am deeply concerned about this matter."},{"m":"If something moves deeply it moves to or at depth.","e":"In this part of the river salmon swim deeply."}]}]},"vocal":{"h":"vocal","i":"/ˈvəʊ.kəl/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Mélange a trois-vocal.wav","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"Vocal cords, groups, performances, etc. are related to the voice or speaking.","e":"She has a beautiful vocal range and can sing both high and low notes effortlessly."},{"m":"If your are vocal, you speak out about topics you care about.","e":"She's a vocal critic of the government."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"A vocal is the musical part performed by singers.","e":"The song has a beautiful melody together with a great vocal."}]}]},"vocals":{"h":"vocals","l":"vocal","q":"noun"},"vocalize":{"h":"vocalize","i":"/ˈvoʊ.kə.laɪz/","a":"en-us-vocalize.ogg","s":[{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"If you vocalize, you express yourself with your voice."}]}]},"vocalizes":{"h":"vocalizes","l":"vocalize","q":"verb"},"vocalized":{"h":"vocalized","l":"vocalize","q":"verb"},"vocalizing":{"h":"vocalizing","l":"vocalize","q":"verb"},"vocalise":{"h":"vocalise","i