e, surprise, or happiness.","e":"Aah! That feels good!"}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"(intransitive) (informal) When a person aahs, they express amazement, joy, or surprise by saying [[#Interjection|aah]]."}]},{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Aah is expression of pleasure, surprise, or happiness."}]}]},"spastics":{"h":"spastics","l":"spastic","q":"noun"},"gayness":{"h":"gayness","i":"/ˈɡeɪ.nəs/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-gayness.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Gayness is the state of being joyful and carefree."},{"m":"Gayness is the brightness of color."},{"m":"Gayness is the quality of being gay."}]}]},"palsy":{"h":"palsy","i":"/ˈpɔːlzi/","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-palsy1.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Palsy is the complete or partial muscle paralysis of a body part by that usually involves involuntary tremors."}]},{"p":"verb","d":[{"m":"Affect with paralysis and involuntary tremors."}]}]},"palsies":{"h":"palsies","l":"palsy","q":"noun"},"palsying":{"h":"palsying","l":"palsy","q":"verb"},"palsied":{"h":"palsied","l":"palsy","q":"verb"},"mofo":{"h":"mofo","i":"/ˈməʊfəʊ/","a":"en-au-mofo.ogg","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"(countable) Another word for taboo word meaning motherfucker."}]}]},"aahs":{"h":"aahs","l":"aah","q":"verb"},"aahed":{"h":"aahed","l":"aah","q":"verb"},"aahing":{"h":"aahing","l":"aah","q":"verb"},"aardvarks":{"h":"aardvarks","l":"aardvark","q":"noun"},"extensible":{"h":"extensible","s":[{"p":"adjective","d":[{"m":"If something is extensible, it can be extended."}]}]},"mofos":{"h":"mofos","l":"mofo","q":"noun"},"nancies":{"h":"nancies","l":"nancy","q":"noun"},"queerness":{"h":"queerness","a":"LL-Q1860 (eng)-NaomiAmethyst-queerness.wav","s":[{"p":"noun","d":[{"m":"Queerness is the state of being odd."},{"m":"Queerness is the quality or characteristic of having a sexual or gender identity that does not correspond to established ideas of sexuality and gender, especially heterosexual norms."},{"m":"Queerness is the state of being gay."}]}]},"gayly":{"h":"gayly"